  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-013",
    "title": "镇中借宿"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_071",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "妇人推开后门：“从这里走，去镇中低地。那里有一口被填过的井。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "无灯镇没有城门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1897,
          "end": 1897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石碑之后，屋舍沿一条弯曲的土路散开。路边没有灯柱，没有灯笼，连屋檐下常见的火盆也被泥盖住。雨水从瓦缝间落下，镇子里的人却走得很快，像是害怕在空地上停留太久。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1899,
          "end": 1899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白发老妇拄着木杖，领他们进了一间低矮的客舍。客舍只有两间房，墙上挂着一幅褪色的山水画，画中唯一的灯被人用黑墨涂去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1901,
          "end": 1901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一间房，两张床。”老妇说，“入夜不点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1903,
          "end": 1903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们要找三个人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1905,
          "end": 1905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇将热水放在桌上：“三个人叫什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1907,
          "end": 1907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离在桌下轻轻踢了他一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1909,
          "end": 1909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临改口：“三名从玄霄宗来的引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1911,
          "end": 1911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇的手停在半空。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1913,
          "end": 1913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里不收引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1915,
          "end": 1915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1917,
          "end": 1917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前也不收。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1919,
          "end": 1919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她转身要走，陆照临看见她腰间挂着一块旧木牌。木牌上刻着半盏灯，缺口处嵌着灰白石屑。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1921,
          "end": 1921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这块牌子从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1923,
          "end": 1923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇低头看了看：“捡的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1925,
          "end": 1925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1927,
          "end": 1927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“井边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1929,
          "end": 1929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镇里有井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1931,
          "end": 1931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇没有回答，端起空碗离开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1933,
          "end": 1933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到窗边，掀开一角帘子。街上有五六个人站在屋檐下，彼此之间不说话，只用眼神交换消息。一个穿蓝布衣的中年人抬头看见他们，立即关上门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1935,
          "end": 1935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镇民认识引灯人。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1937,
          "end": 1937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们也认识那口井。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1939,
          "end": 1939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先别去找。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1941,
          "end": 1941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1943,
          "end": 1943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“老妇说入夜不点灯。现在还没入夜，她却不肯提井，说明有人在白天也盯着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1945,
          "end": 1945
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无灯镇的石碑规矩写在纸上：入夜不点灯，问路不问名，见到引路人，不要跟随。写到第三条时，掌心残印传来一阵凉意。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1947,
          "end": 1947
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1949,
          "end": 1949
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个十岁左右的男孩抱着空篮子站在门口。他的左耳缺了一小块，像被火燎过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1951,
          "end": 1951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们从山上来？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1953,
          "end": 1953
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叫什么？”陆照临下意识开口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1955,
          "end": 1955
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩立刻后退。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1957,
          "end": 1957
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离挡住陆照临：“别问名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1959,
          "end": 1959
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩盯着他们手里的小灯：“那盏灯是谁给的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1961,
          "end": 1961
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个朋友。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1963,
          "end": 1963
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“朋友会点灯吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1965,
          "end": 1965
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他说不要点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1967,
          "end": 1967
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩点点头：“那就对了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1969,
          "end": 1969
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把篮子放到门边，篮底压着一张湿纸。纸上画着一座井，井边站着三个没有脸的人。三个身影之间，连着一条弯曲的青线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1971,
          "end": 1971
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁画的？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1973,
          "end": 1973
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩指了指街对面：“画的人已经不在了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1975,
          "end": 1975
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1977,
          "end": 1977
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“井里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1979,
          "end": 1979
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有继续问。男孩捡起篮子，转身跑进雨里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1981,
          "end": 1981
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临展开湿纸。青线的形状与残印缺口一致，井口旁还写着一个被水冲淡的日期：冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1983,
          "end": 1983
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "傍晚时，镇上开始收门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1985,
          "end": 1985
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "每家每户都先关窗，再用泥封住门缝。没有人点灯，屋内却陆续亮起微弱的蓝光，像有人把萤火藏在墙里。白发老妇送来两碗热粥，神情比白天更紧张。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1987,
          "end": 1987
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“今晚不要出门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1989,
          "end": 1989
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“井在哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1991,
          "end": 1991
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇把碗放下：“镇里没有井。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1993,
          "end": 1993
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那孩子说有人去了井里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1995,
          "end": 1995
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1999,
          "end": 1999
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不该问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2001,
          "end": 2001
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，有三个人来到这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2003,
          "end": 2003
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临全身一震。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2031,
          "end": 2031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“忘记名字之后留下的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2226,
          "end": 2226
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影子撞门第二次。门框裂开一道细缝，青光从缝中流进来。陆照临把普通引路灯抱在胸前，灯罩内的缺口与墙上路线图重合。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2228,
          "end": 2228
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有点灯，灯却自行发出极低的嗡鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2230,
          "end": 2230
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人退到墙角：“不该亮的灯，不能在这里亮。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2232,
          "end": 2232
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将灯放到地上，按住灯罩。嗡鸣声停止，掌心残印却骤然发热。他看见墙上那三个被刮去的姓氏重新浮出一瞬：陆、顾、叶。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2234,
          "end": 2234
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抓住他的手腕：“别再看。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2236,
          "end": 2236
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门板在这时彻底裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2238,
          "end": 2238
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一道人形影子站在门外，脸部空白，手里提着一盏没有灯芯的灯。它没有脚，身体却向前滑动，灯罩内传出第三章灰背猿般的低吼。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2240,
          "end": 2240
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人将篮子里的灰叶撒向门口。灰叶遇到影子，立刻燃起无焰的蓝火。影子后退半步，转身向街道深处滑去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2242,
          "end": 2242
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它怕什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2244,
          "end": 2244
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怕有人记得三个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2246,
          "end": 2246
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人推开后门：“从这里走，去镇中低地。那里有一口被填过的井。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2248,
          "end": 2248
        }
      }
    ],
